\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30001178 (OWR-3392-004). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Mini-Workshop: Product Systems and Independence in Quantum Dynamics (2009), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2009/09, pp. 493--548; official report source and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2009/09}.
\item[S3] Official EMS Press PDF of the same Oberwolfach report; PDF page 38, printed page 530.
\url{https://ems.press/content/serial-article-files/46209}.
\item[S4] Skeide free product systems and adapted cocycles; reference in the saved dated catalogue literature review.
\url{https://iris.unimol.it/handle/11695/18113}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30001178}

